# Vercel serves only the static UI in workers/public (see vercel.json); the API
# stays on the Cloudflare Worker. Everything else is kept out of the build so
# Vercel does not treat api/*.py as Python functions and bundle the pipeline's
# requirements.txt (duckdb, pandas, pyarrow, lightgbm...), which exceeds the
# 500 MB function limit. That FastAPI app also needs the gitignored data/ and
# model/ directories, so it cannot run on Vercel in any case.
/*
!workers
!vercel.json

workers/.wrangler
workers/wrangler.toml
